"answer": "Project Zenith is an initiative aimed at optimizing cloud storage solutions, enhancing security, and leveraging AI for predictive analytics and data visualization. Key milestones include the initiation in Q3 2023 with Marcus Cole as the leader, the successful testing of a secure file sharing prototype ahead of schedule, and a breakthrough in predictive analytics. The project involves gathering R&D ideas by July 20th, exploring partnerships with TechInnovate, and allocating budgets for compliance ($55,000) and training ($15,000). Feedback on the prototype is being sought by the end of November, with a detailed progress report scheduled for the staff meeting on November 20th."
